---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Terms and Conditions | MSDEVBUILD Azure" description="Terms for using MSDEVBUILD Azure tutorials, quizzes and mock exams, including the educational-use disclaimer and trademark notice." wide={false}>
  <div class="lesson">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight">Terms and Conditions</h1>
    <p><em>Last updated: 11 November 2026</em></p>
    <h2 id="use">Educational use</h2>
    <p>Content is provided free for personal learning. Please link to lessons rather than copying them wholesale.</p>
    <h2 id="accuracy">Accuracy</h2>
    <p>We work hard to keep lessons accurate and in line with the current exam outline, but cloud services and exams change. Content is provided “as is” without warranty. Always confirm critical details in the official Microsoft documentation.</p>
    <h2 id="practice">Practice questions</h2>
    <p>All questions are original practice material. They are not real Microsoft exam questions, and a mock exam score does not guarantee any exam result.</p>
    <h2 id="trademarks">Trademarks</h2>
    <p>Microsoft, Azure, Microsoft Entra and related names are trademarks of the Microsoft group of companies. This site is independent and not endorsed by Microsoft.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
